# DUSKLING M20, THE WARDEN'S FLOOR (room 20): the Brass Warden: six slams while it is solid, then the door opens.
# Played from its way in with plain button presses (LEFT is the D-pad
# side, A the button side), found once by the route finder.
game duskling
wait 5
cheat room 20
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 30
hold LEFT+A 16
hold A 26
hold LEFT 5
hold LEFT+A 16
hold LEFT 12
